    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The ordinary least-squares (OLS) estimate of $ \\beta $ is the b vector that minimizes the residual sum of squares,",
      "source_page": 216,
      "printed_page": 196,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter8:p024:b10"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        154.0,
