        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "691697088eba51441eade5fea51c232a1929b44b70b1e99f3569beabf09734e4"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Taking derivatives, it can be shown that our desired estimate satisfies",
